{"ref":"powerup:greed","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":128,"h":107,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Greed is one of the stats in Vampire Survivors. It affects the amount of ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Pile.png","w":24,"h":24}," Gold Coins that are gained from pickups and ",{"i":"Sprite-Treasure_Chest.png","w":24,"h":23}," Treasure Chests."]},{"k":"p","c":["The player has 100% base Greed before modifications. The Greed in the stat panel is given as the difference to the base Greed, meaning that Greed stat of +30% equals to 130% total Greed, for example. Greed modifications from character bonuses, PowerUps and items stack additively. Stage bonuses to gold gained do not count as Greed and stack multiplicatively with the collective bonus from the aforementioned."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how much Greed the player may have."]},{"k":"p","c":["Greed also affects Base Damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Night_Sword.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:night-sword"}," ",{"t":"Night Sword","r":"weapon:night-sword"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Muramasa.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:muramasa"}," ",{"t":"Muramasa","r":"weapon:muramasa"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Victorian_Horror_(XVIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:victorian-horror-xviii"}," ",{"t":"Victorian Horror (XVIII)","r":"arcana:victorian-horror-xviii"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Colonel_Bahamut.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"character:colonel-bahamut"}," ",{"t":"Colonel Bahamut","r":"character:colonel-bahamut"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OperationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Operation Guns DLC to access"}," gains +1% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"}," per +1% Greed."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["2 January 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["GREED"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+10%"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Greed PowerUp increases Greed by 10% per rank, with a maximum rank of 5. At rank 5, it provides +50% Greed. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 200."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Greed"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["2"]},{"c":["+20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["3"]},{"c":["+30%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["4"]},{"c":["+40%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5"]},{"c":["+50%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Greed's associated passive item is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":15,"h":12,"r":"passive:stone-mask"}," ",{"t":"Stone Mask","r":"passive:stone-mask"},", which provides +10% Greed per level, up to a maximum of +50% Greed at level 5."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Pearl_magatama.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"passive:pearl-magatama"}," ",{"t":"Pearl magatama","r":"passive:pearl-magatama"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheMoonSpell.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Moonspell DLC to access"}," will provide -7% Greed per level, up to a maximum of -35% Greed at level 6."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Velvet_Dodecahedron.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:velvet-dodecahedron"}," ",{"t":"Velvet Dodecahedron","r":"passive:velvet-dodecahedron"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheBloodmoon.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Bloodmoon DLC to access"},"will provide +20% Greed per even level, up to a maximum of +60% Greed at level 6."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Golden_Egg.png","w":22,"h":24}," Golden Egg permanently increases Greed by 1% for the character that collected it."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-arcana","title":"From arcana","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wicked_Season_(XIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," ",{"t":"Wicked Season (XIII)","r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," doubles Greed in certain 10 second intervals, and gives +0.5% Greed every level."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-characters","title":"From characters","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"from-characters-base-game","title":"Base Game","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sir_Ambrojoe.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:sir-ambrojoe"}," ",{"t":"Ambrojoe","r":"character:sir-ambrojoe"}," starts with +20% Greed."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Iguana_Gallo_Valletto.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"}," ",{"t":"Gallo","r":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Divano_Thelma.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:divano-thelma"}," ",{"t":"Divano","r":"character:divano-thelma"}," reduce Greed by -50%."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Leda.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:leda"}," ",{"t":"Leda","r":"character:leda"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Boon_Marrabbio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:boon-marrabbio"}," ",{"t":"Marrabbio","r":"character:boon-marrabbio"}," reduce Greed by -80%."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Big_Trouser.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"character:big-trouser"}," ",{"t":"Trouser","r":"character:big-trouser"}," starts with +20% Greed and gains +1% Greed every level, with no cap."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-legacy-of-the-moonspell","title":"Legacy of the Moonspell","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Syuuto_Moonspell.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:megalo-syuuto-moonspell"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Syuuto","r":"character:megalo-syuuto-moonspell"}," starts with +50% Greed."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-tides-of-the-foscari","title":"Tides of the Foscari","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[